msgctxt "80"
msgid "What happened? I thought you were gonna teach me a lesson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Shit, he's strong..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"What in high hell's goin' on over here? Someone causin'\r\n"
"trouble on our turf!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Aniki, help! This guy's gonna fucking wreck us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Looks like he already did, Hiroshi. He start shit with you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Yeah! He's got beef with the Kazama Family or somethin'!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Hold your horses there. You're the ones who started this,\r\n"
"not me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Grrr! Shut up, you old bitch!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Oh, well if it ain't the Fourth Chairman! How you been?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Don't \"huh\" me! Go on and introduce yourself, idiot!\r\n"
"This man here's Kazuma Kiryu, Tojo Clan fourth chairman!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "<Italic>What!?</Italic>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "It's an honor to meet you, sir!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "You there. You're Kazama Family, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Yes, sir! The name's Aniki, but you can call me Aniki-aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"...I think I'll just stick to Aniki. Anyway, do you know\r\n"
"where I can find Majima-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Hm... That's a good question."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"Since he left the Tojo Clan to start Majima Construction,\r\n"
"it's been impossible to know where he might pop up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"Though now that I think about it, he was actually scheduled\r\n"
"for a meeting with the boss today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"You might catch him over at the <Color:7>Kazama Family<Color:Default> "
"office\r\n"
"if you're lucky."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Thanks, I'll go take a look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Oh, and um, Fourth Chairman..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "My boys didn't offend you, did they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"Nah, it was nothing. They could just use a little more\r\n"
"education, is all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "That so? Guess I'll have to beat some manners into 'em then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, I already did. Just keep an eye on them, make\r\n"
"sure they take the lesson they learned today to heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "I'll do that, sir! Thank you, sir!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "Well, I should get going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Goodbye, Fourth Chairman!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"After earning a certain number of <Color:7>experience "
"points<Color:Default>,\r\n"
"you will be able to <Color:7>upgrade your abilities<Color:Default> on the "
"<Color:7>Upgrades screen<Color:Default>.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"You will earn <Color:7>experience points<Color:Default> not only from "
"defeating\r\n"
"enemies, but also by completing substories."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "Well, well, well! Look who it is!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "Oh, you're the brats from before. What now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Grrr, you think you're hot shit, huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "This is the guy, senpai!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"Oho? So you're one who beat up my tender little friend here,\r\n"
"huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid ""
"Hehehe! You're in trouble now, old man! Our senpai here's\r\n"
"in the Kazama Family! Yeah, that's right! The guys who own\r\n"
"this damn town! Well? You shittin' yourself yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "Look at this bitch! He's so scared he can't even talk!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"What's wrong, cat got your tongue? Way I hear it, you were\r\n"
"acting real tough toward my pals here not too long ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "Well guess what? I'm here to even the odds! You catch me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid ""
"Look man, I got a Kazama Family pin right here! They don't\r\n"
"go handing these out on the street, y'know! I'm a big man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"Now if you don't wanna meet my big fists, I might be able\r\n"
"to find it in my heart to forgive you... for a price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "The shit are you laughin' at!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "A Kazama Family pin, huh? Funny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid ""
"Back in my day, nobody'd dare brag about their loyalty\r\n"
"without knowing who they were up against. That's how you\r\n"
"get yourself killed, kid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Oh yeah!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid ""
"Look, just do yourselves a favor and run along now. I'm not\r\n"
"interested in wasting my time with scum like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid ""
"You think you can boss Kazama Family boys around!?\r\n"
"We're gonna bash your fuckin' brains in!"
msgstr ""

